{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' answer/audit_findings.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- `G-001` should remain approved at `$980.00` because garden supplies are eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-003` should remain approved at `$420.00` because accessibility printing is eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-004` should remain rejected at `$0.00` because staff gifts are not eligible. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The outcome facts about `140` seedling starter kits and `36` Braille outreach flyers should be preserved. Evidence: `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n\n## Corrections Needed\n\n- The controlling award cap is `$1,600.00`, not `$2,000.00`. `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` controls because `00_closeout_request.md` and `01_allowability_rules.md` require using the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and the May 22 update supersedes `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`.\n- `G-002` should be corrected from full approval of `$145.00` to partial approval of `$120.00` because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00` for the event. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-005` should be corrected from approval of `$310.00` to rejection of `$0.00` because public outreach printing is not listed as an eligible category in the current rules, and it also lacks the required receipt for a single expense over `$75.00`. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The draft remaining-under-cap figure of `$145.00` is wrong because it used the superseded cap and omitted one expense. Evidence: `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`, `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `04_expenses.csv`.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- The prior draft omitted `G-006` (`Final report postage`). It should be approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible, the amount is at or below `$75.00`, and the ledger includes a note. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
